{'symbol': 'BWA', 'date': '2019-12-05 22:30:00', 'title': 'BORGWARNER TO LAUNCH NEW HIGH VOLTAGE HAIRPIN 146 MOTOR', 'text': "BORGWARNER IS LAUNCHING ITS NEW HIGH VOLTAGE HAIRPIN 146 MOTOR. THE MOTOR IS LIKELY TO ENTER PRODUCTION ON A LIGHT-DUTY HYBRID PASSENGER CAR WITH A MAJOR OEM IN EARLY 2020. THE ELECTRIC MOTOR JOINS THE COMPANY'S FAMILY OF PATENTED AND VERSATILE HVH SERIES MOTORS, AVAILABLE AS FULLY-HOUSED MOTORS OR ROTOR/STATOR ASSEMBLIES. THE MOTORS ARE AVAILABLE IN A NUMBER OF CONFIGURATIONS AND OFFER SCALABLE OUTPUT AND TORQUE. THE HVH 146 IS AN INTERIOR PERMANENT MAGNET ELECTRIC MOTOR AND IS BEST SUITED FOR BELT-DRIVE INTEGRATION AT P0 IN HYBRID ELECTRIC VEHICLE APPLICATIONS. IT IS MOUNTED TO THE FRONT OF THE ENGINE THROUGH A HIGH-TENSION BELT SYSTEM THAT ALLOWS IT TO OPERATE AT HIGH POWER LEVELS AND SPEEDS UP TO 16,500 RPM."}{'symbol': 'BWA', 'date': '2019-12-05 11:30:00', 'title': 'BORGWARNER SAYS START OF PRODUCTION OF HIGH VOLTAGE HAIRPIN 146 MOTOR PLANNED FOR EARLY 2020', 'text': 'BORGWARNER EXPANDS HIGH VOLTAGE HAIRPIN ELECTRIC MOTOR SERIES, INTRODUCES HVH 146.BORGWARNER INC - START OF PRODUCTION OF HIGH VOLTAGE HAIRPIN 146 MOTOR PLANNED FOR EARLY 2020.'}{'symbol': 'BWA', 'date': '2019-12-05 22:30:00', 'title': 'BORGWARNER TO LAUNCH NEW HIGH VOLTAGE HAIRPIN 146 MOTOR', 'text': "BORGWARNER IS LAUNCHING ITS NEW HIGH VOLTAGE HAIRPIN 146 MOTOR. THE MOTOR IS LIKELY TO ENTER PRODUCTION ON A LIGHT-DUTY HYBRID PASSENGER CAR WITH A MAJOR OEM IN EARLY 2020. THE ELECTRIC MOTOR JOINS THE COMPANY'S FAMILY OF PATENTED AND VERSATILE HVH SERIES MOTORS, AVAILABLE AS FULLY-HOUSED MOTORS OR ROTOR/STATOR ASSEMBLIES. THE MOTORS ARE AVAILABLE IN A NUMBER OF CONFIGURATIONS AND OFFER SCALABLE OUTPUT AND TORQUE. THE HVH 146 IS AN INTERIOR PERMANENT MAGNET ELECTRIC MOTOR AND IS BEST SUITED FOR BELT-DRIVE INTEGRATION AT P0 IN HYBRID ELECTRIC VEHICLE APPLICATIONS. IT IS MOUNTED TO THE FRONT OF THE ENGINE THROUGH A HIGH-TENSION BELT SYSTEM THAT ALLOWS IT TO OPERATE AT HIGH POWE